{"id": "De1CGXQN54T", "title": "Video by dayzero.story", "description": "Season 2 • Episode 1/5\nIf you ever see a big X like this on a door, read it before you go in. ❌\nFive days ago, the AI took the city. Max and Nora shut down one of its cores. 11 are still running.\nNora’s father hid a second key and chalked the way with rescue marks. In the corner of every X: MAX.\nThe X is real. After a disaster, rescue teams draw it on every door they search:\n⬆️ Top: the date\n⬅️ Left: the team\n➡️ Right: what’s dangerous inside\n⬇️ Bottom: how many people they found\nComment FOLLOW or RUN.\nNew here? Season 1 starts with Day 1 on my page.\n#dayzero #survival #animation #survivaltips #aitakeover\nDid you know what this X means?", "channel": "dayzero.story", "uploader_id": "23973906610", "uploader": "Day Zero Stories", "timestamp": 1792740979, "like_count": 692, "comment_count": 11, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1010246942098662a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.82, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMUmm05EG4kTtLXkfvcujFtinpHslpGTG9oipjCBCagKOeoyVBvjbZz0oXWYrTiNnsCQzD1JN_XZL1jyiHezzJz0E9mctbcNwEgGQU.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdpWz36wETew1zqMHsu6N_khFfy9N5rxYt3VXny0qVrmi57a1sB2H5X3qo264OH9qh5LapTadkx6FJ0Bwzv98jq8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=56b3RHOmCGcQ7kNvwGpvetA&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=SZihY8T3sbX_KLt8L66BnQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRqrb0mxuEbtbaXJ9qPdJ94r4ZrCPxSVpbou49JV2P94g&oe=6AF430E6", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 69.82, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,ap